# English Only

All project documentation and code comments must be written in **English**.

## Applies To

- README and any markdown in the repo
- Files in `docs/`
- Inline and block comments in source code (TS, TSX, JS, JSX, CSS, config)
- Commit messages (recommended)
- AGENTS.md and .cursor/rules

## Examples

```typescript
// Good: English comment
// Validate user input before submit

// Bad: Non-English comment
// اعتبارسنجی ورودی کاربر
```

```tsx
{/* Good: English */}
{/* Primary navigation links */}

{/* Bad: Non-English */}
{/* لینک‌های منوی اصلی */}
```

User-facing UI text (labels, buttons, messages) may be in Farsi; comments and docs stay in English.
